<title>USA: Zila sees FY97 revs boost from Bio-Dental.</title>
<headline>Zila sees FY97 revs boost from Bio-Dental.</headline>
<dateline>PHOENIX, Ariz. 1996-11-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Zila Inc said Monday it expects its annual revenue to increase to about $40 million in fiscal 1997 with its acquisition of Bio-Dental Technologies Corp.</p>
<p>The company's fiscal 1996 revenues were about $6.8 million.</p>
<p>Zila, which markets oral healthcare products, announced the Bio-Dental acquisition in August.</p>
</text>
